  "body": "Our serious vendors are overseas-bound. Their bags are packed and their motivation is high.\r\n\r\nOutstanding value for money here at this sunny, warm, bright, and welcoming home with generous living space, loads of natural light, and a fantastic private position. Brookvale Park feels like a little secret world of tree lined streets, birdsong, peace, quiet and safety, but hidden away in the very heart of Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nThis spacious standalone home enjoys living areas that flow beautifully, incorporating a great-sized open plan kitchen/dining area and a large separate lounge leading to the entertaining deck - just perfect for those summertime BBQ vibes. A rumpus/office space and a garden make for plenty of extra room for the kids and pets. Gardeners will be delighted at the sizeable blank and sunny canvas here.\r\n\r\nAn extra-lengthy tandem double car port and heaps of under-house storage means the cars and kayaks are housed too, and there are a few extras here including a garden shed for those with green fingers and two heat pumps to crank up for those who enjoy their cosy winter nights.\r\n\r\nThis home is tidy, more than liveable as it is, but it also offers the potential to refresh and personalise over time if so desired. A small and simple Body Corp covers house insurance and some exterior maintenance making your life even easier.\r\n\r\nGiven the proximity to stunning beaches, schools, all amenities, and the nearing completion of what some are calling the 'game changer' Penlink, we don’t think you could go far wrong here in terms of the highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nOne of those character family homes with 'Feel Good' fuzzies that deserve your attention in person. See you at the Open Home or call to easily arrange a private viewing - swiftly, because we had to ask twice about this price!",
